title: 'C-c m n p : skg-mark-node-processed'
pid: 2041efdb-936d-4cf3-817c-555535747245
body: |2-
  Marks the node at point processed, then saves: the changes of the node
  itself, not its relationship to the headline above it. With C-u, the
  node of every headline in the subtree; with C-u C-u, the same, the
  server walking outward from new nodes (see the preamble).
